Installation instructions for XPilot NG
=======================================

See BUILDING.md.

The short version:

    sudo apt install build-essential \
        libx11-dev libsm-dev libice-dev \
        libgl-dev libglu1-mesa-dev \
        libsdl1.2-dev libsdl-ttf2.0-dev libsdl-image1.2-dev \
        libexpat1-dev zlib1g-dev

    cmake -B build -S .
    cmake --build build -j"$(nproc)"
    sudo cmake --install build

Binaries are left in build/bin and also run directly from the source tree
without installing.

Note: this file previously carried the generic autoconf instructions. The
autotools build was removed in Phase 1 of ROADMAP.md and there is no
./configure script any more.
